# 🛒 Java E-Commerce Application

## 📌 Project Description

The **Java E-Commerce Application** is a console-based online shopping simulation developed using Java.

It allows users to browse products, add products to a shopping cart, view cart details, calculate total prices, and simulate placing orders.

This project demonstrates fundamental Java programming concepts, Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), and Java Collections.

## 🚀 Features

- View available products
- Add products to shopping cart
- Select product quantities
- Update cart quantities by adding more items
- View shopping cart
- Calculate total bill
- Simulate order checkout
- Clear cart after checkout
- Basic input validation

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **Programming Language:** Java
- **IDE:** VS Code / Eclipse / IntelliJ IDEA
- **JDK:** Java 8 or above
- **Concepts:** OOP, ArrayList, Scanner, Loops, Conditional Statements

