## ⚙️ Installation and Setup

### Step 1: Install Java

Install JDK 8 or above.

### Step 2: Clone the Repository

After uploading your project to GitHub, run:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Java-E-Commerce-Application.git
```

Replace `YOUR_USERNAME` with your GitHub username.

### Step 3: Open the Project

```bash
cd Java-E-Commerce-Application
```

### Step 4: Compile the Program

```bash
javac src/EcommerceApp.java
```

### Step 5: Run the Program

```bash
java -cp src EcommerceApp
```

